	(text "J501: the 4 gauge wires (silicone, S+/S- and E+/E-\ntwisted), anchored, then soldered here. The bridge\ncloses at the gauges (sheet Plot bed board).\nC504/C505: pads for later (C0G), not fitted.\nE- is its own wire: never joined to GND here."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 72.39 0)
